# Accessibility UI Rule

- Preserve WCAG 2.1 AA keyboard behavior for menu and search.
- Every interactive element must be reachable and operable by keyboard.
- Keep clear visible focus states (`:focus-visible`).
- Do not remove skip link or landmark roles.
- Respect min touch target size (~44px) on mobile controls.
- Keep `aria-expanded`, `aria-controls`, and labels in sync with JS state.
- Avoid introducing motion-heavy effects without reduced-motion fallback.

